## Product Notes

### Domains

Turbify offers ai domain search, registration, and domain management tools for small businesses. Domain pricing, renewal terms, promotional pricing, and TLD availability may vary. Use the current Domains page as the source of truth.

### Web Hosting

Turbify offers web hosting plans for small businesses that need a website, business presence, and hosting support. Hosting features and pricing may vary by plan. Use the current Web Hosting page as the source of truth.

### WordPress Hosting

Turbify offers WordPress hosting for businesses that want to create and manage websites using WordPress. Use the current WordPress Hosting page as the source of truth.

### Business Email

Turbify offers branded business email using a custom domain. Use the current Business Email page as the source of truth.

### SSL Certificates

Turbify offers SSL certificates to help secure websites and support visitor trust. Use the current SSL Certificates page as the source of truth.

### Localworks

Turbify Localworks helps small businesses manage local listings on directories like Yelp, Google Reviews, and more. Businesses can also improve their online presence across directories using one dashboard and update reviews and social media posts. Use the current Localworks page as the source of truth.

### Stores

Turbify Stores helps small businesses build, grow, and manage their online ecommerce presence with a powerful proprietary store environment. 

### WooCommerce

WooCommerce is the ecommerce version of WordPress helping businesses build an online ecommerce presence with plugins and resources that help them grow online.

